    "body": "Update both ISE dependencies to the same tested conditional-comparison commit, already merged through Nextcore-ISE PR #5. This makes CCMP/CCMN available to the existing direct and Rust-memory-service execution paths without changing the EFI ABI or feature defaults.\n\nA fresh standalone EFI clone with an empty Cargo cache resolved canonical Git dependencies, built default/direct/combined firmware, and passed the all-features UEFI check. The newly built combined firmware executed all 13 authored conditional-comparison cases in actual x86 OVMF, checking registers, PSTATE, PC, retirement and fault state. No local source patch or runtime override was used for the build. Normal macOS boot and guest Metal remain incomplete.",
